  m_text: "Goal: Take control of a starting villager and possess the ones that remain\n\nControls:\r\nButtons - Tap the icons to open up menus and options to restart the level\r\n\r\nStarting the level - First select your starting possessed by tapping a villager\r\n\r\nMovement - Tap on the possessed you wish to move, then on an adjacent space, tap once to select and a second time to confirm.\r\n\r\nPossessing - When Adjacent to a enemy (Unpossessed Villager) with one of your possessed, tap the space the enemy is on once to select and again to confirm. \r\n"
